{
  "category": "Darkness Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "SABLEYE lead quiet lives deep inside caverns. They are feared, however, because these POKéMON are thought to steal the spirits of people when their eyes burn with a sinister glow in the darkness.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "SABLEYE digs the ground with sharpened claws to find rocks that it eats. Substances in the eaten rocks crystallize and rise up to the POKéMON’s body surface.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It digs branching holes in caves using its sharp claws in search of food--raw gems. A SABLEYE lurks in darkness and is seen only rarely.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It feeds on gemstone crystals. In darkness, its eyes sparkle with the glitter of jewels.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It feeds on gemstone crystals. In darkness, its eyes sparkle with the glitter of jewels.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "It dwells in the darkness of caves. It uses its sharp claws to dig up gems to nourish itself.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
